# Local-only, never pushed (owner's decision, 2026-09-24).
# The Claude Code setup and the project context/decision history stay on this
# machine. See context/05-SESSION-LOG.md for the backup caveat: these files are
# NOT version-controlled, so losing the drive loses the decision history.
